      "_id": "ecbfa653cf4c4303",
      "name": "Combination Discipline — Eyes of Blades",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Assamites who hone both their preternatural senses and their speed learn a valuable secret: sometimes it is wiser to defend than to attack. A vampire with this power enters a brief trance in which she perceives every threat against her at once, assessing and reacting to each in turn.</p><p><strong>System:</strong> At the start of a combat turn, before actions are declared, the player spends two Blood Traits and a Willpower Trait to activate this power (this counts as activating Celerity for the turn). The character takes no offensive action that turn, but may defend against every attack made against her, contesting each one individually. This power may be used no more than a number of times per scene equal to the character's Perception Trait total.</p>",
        "source": "Libellus Sanguinis III: Wolves at the Door, Book Two: Saracens",
        "discipline": "Celerity",
        "level": "intermediate",
        "challengeType": "physical",
        "bloodCost": "2",
